    "If any of these are happening, do not wait for the app. Call 112 in the Netherlands or your local emergency number." : {
      "comment" : "A warning message that appears when the user has selected one or more emergency red flags.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If any of these are happening, do not wait for the app. Call 112 in the Netherlands or your local emergency number."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als een van deze dingen gebeurt, wacht dan niet op de app. Bel 112 in Nederland of je lokale noodnummer."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si está ocurriendo alguna de estas cosas, no esperes a la app. Llama al 112 en los Países Bajos o a tu número de emergencia local."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn eines davon passiert, warte nicht auf die App. Ruf in den Niederlanden 112 oder deine örtliche Notrufnummer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If anything feels unclear, contact your prescriber, GGD, or pharmacist before relying on the plan." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als iets onduidelijk voelt, neem dan contact op met je voorschrijver, GGD of apotheker voor je op het plan vertrouwt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si algo no está claro, contacta con tu prescriptor, el GGD o tu farmacéutico antes de confiar en el plan."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn etwas unklar ist, kontaktiere deine verschreibende Person, GGD oder Apotheker, bevor du dich auf den Plan verlässt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If ChillMate has helped you feel a little safer or more in control, a small tip is a lovely way to say thanks. Every bit goes straight back into keeping the app running, updated, and free for everyone." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the benefits of tipping for ChillMate.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If ChillMate has helped you feel a little safer or more in control, a small tip is a lovely way to say thanks. Every bit goes straight back into keeping the app running, updated, and free for everyone."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als ChillMate je heeft geholpen je iets veiliger of meer in controle te voelen, is een kleine fooi een mooie manier om bedankt te zeggen. Alles gaat rechtstreeks terug naar het draaiend, bijgewerkt en gratis houden van de app voor iedereen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si ChillMate te ha ayudado a sentirte un poco más seguro o con más control, una pequeña propina es una bonita forma de dar las gracias. Cada aportación se destina directamente a mantener la app en marcha, actualizada y gratis para todos."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn ChillMate dir geholfen hat, dich etwas sicherer oder selbstbestimmter zu fühlen, ist ein kleines Trinkgeld eine schöne Art, Danke zu sagen. Jeder Beitrag fließt direkt zurück, um die App am Laufen, aktuell und für alle kostenlos zu halten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If someone is unconscious, very confused, overheating, having chest pain, breathing oddly, or cannot be woken: call 112." : {
      "comment" : "A warning to call emergency services if someone is in danger.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If someone is unconscious, very confused, overheating, having chest pain, breathing oddly, or cannot be woken: call 112."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als iemand bewusteloos is, erg verward, oververhit, pijn op de borst heeft, raar ademt of niet wakker te krijgen is: bel 112."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si alguien está inconsciente, muy confuso, con sobrecalentamiento, con dolor en el pecho, respirando de forma extraña o no se puede despertar: llama al 112."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn jemand bewusstlos, sehr verwirrt, überhitzt ist, Brustschmerzen hat, seltsam atmet oder nicht aufgeweckt werden kann: ruf 112."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If someone may be in immediate danger, call local emergency services." : {
      "comment" : "A warning message that instructs users to call emergency services if they are in immediate danger.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If someone may be in immediate danger, call local emergency services."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als iemand in direct gevaar kan zijn, bel de lokale hulpdiensten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si alguien puede estar en peligro inmediato, llama a los servicios de emergencia locales."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn jemand in unmittelbarer Gefahr sein könnte, ruf den örtlichen Notruf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If there is chest pain, blue lips, seizure, or someone cannot be woken: call emergency services now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bij pijn op de borst, blauwe lippen, een toeval of als iemand niet wakker te krijgen is: bel nu de hulpdiensten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si hay dolor en el pecho, labios azulados, convulsión o alguien no se puede despertar: llama a los servicios de emergencia ahora."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bei Brustschmerzen, blauen Lippen, Krampfanfall oder wenn jemand nicht aufgeweckt werden kann: ruf jetzt den Notruf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If there was a Chill, skipped Chill, sleep, or aftercare moment, you can add it when you feel ready." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als er een Chill, overgeslagen Chill, slaap- of nazorgmoment was, kun je het toevoegen wanneer je er klaar voor bent."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si hubo un Chill, un Chill omitido, sueño o un momento de cuidados posteriores, puedes añadirlo cuando te sientas listo."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn es einen Chill, einen ausgelassenen Chill, Schlaf oder einen Nachsorge-Moment gab, kannst du ihn hinzufügen, wenn du bereit bist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you are unsafe, injured, cannot wake someone, or feel at risk, call 112 or a trusted person now." : {
      "comment" : "A warning message that appears if the user has not selected a safe state.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you are unsafe, injured, cannot wake someone, or feel at risk, call 112 or a trusted person now."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je onveilig bent, gewond bent, iemand niet wakker krijgt of je in gevaar voelt, bel dan nu 112 of een vertrouwd persoon."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si no estás a salvo, estás herido, no puedes despertar a alguien o te sientes en riesgo, llama al 112 o a una persona de confianza ahora."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn du nicht sicher bist, verletzt bist, jemanden nicht aufwecken kannst oder dich in Gefahr fühlst, ruf jetzt 112 oder eine Vertrauensperson."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel pulled to continue, pause first. Check your body, water, food, sleep, consent, and whether someone trusted should know." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the purpose of the pause.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you feel pulled to continue, pause first. Check your body, water, food, sleep, consent, and whether someone trusted should know."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je de drang voelt om door te gaan, pauzeer eerst. Check je lichaam, water, eten, slaap, toestemming en of iemand die je vertrouwt het moet weten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si sientes el impulso de continuar, primero haz una pausa. Revisa tu cuerpo, agua, comida, sueño, consentimiento y si alguien de confianza debería saberlo."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn du den Drang spürst weiterzumachen, pausiere zuerst. Achte auf deinen Körper, Wasser, Essen, Schlaf, Einvernehmen und ob eine Vertrauensperson Bescheid wissen sollte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you might hurt yourself or cannot stay safe. Call 113 or 0800-0113 in the Netherlands." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je jezelf zou kunnen pijn doen of niet veilig kunt blijven. Bel 113 of 0800-0113 in Nederland."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si podrías hacerte daño o no puedes mantenerte a salvo. Llama al 113 o al 0800-0113 en los Países Bajos."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn du dir wehtun könntest oder dich nicht sicher halten kannst. Ruf in den Niederlanden 113 oder 0800-0113 an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you need to step outside, that is always okay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je naar buiten moet stappen, dat mag altijd."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si necesitas salir un momento, siempre está bien."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn du kurz nach draußen musst, ist das immer in Ordnung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you need urgent help, do not wait for the app. Call local emergency services." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je dringend hulp nodig hebt, wacht dan niet op de app. Bel de lokale hulpdiensten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si necesitas ayuda urgente, no esperes a la app. Llama a los servicios de emergencia locales."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn du dringend Hilfe brauchst, warte nicht auf die App. Ruf den örtlichen Notruf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your results are in, add oral, genital, and anal results to ChillMate." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als je uitslagen binnen zijn, voeg orale, genitale en anale uitslagen toe aan ChillMate."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si tienes los resultados, añade los resultados oral, genital y anal a ChillMate."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn deine Ergebnisse da sind, füge orale, genitale und anale Ergebnisse zu ChillMate hinzu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Immediate danger, unconsciousness, or someone who cannot be woken. Call your local emergency number now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Direct gevaar, bewusteloosheid of iemand die niet wakker te krijgen is. Bel nu je lokale noodnummer."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
