          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es ist in Ordnung, gemischte Gefühle darüber zu haben, wo du gerade stehst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is reviewed and updated from time to time as those sources change or new information becomes available." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het wordt van tijd tot tijd herzien en bijgewerkt als die bronnen veranderen of nieuwe informatie beschikbaar komt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se revisa y actualiza de vez en cuando a medida que esas fuentes cambian o aparece nueva información."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sie wird von Zeit zu Zeit überprüft und aktualisiert, wenn sich diese Quellen ändern oder neue Informationen verfügbar werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It sounds like something serious may have happened. You don't have to deal with this alone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It sounds like something serious may have happened. You don't have to deal with this alone."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het klinkt alsof er iets ernstigs is gebeurd. Je hoeft dit niet alleen te verwerken."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Parece que puede haber pasado algo serio. No tienes que afrontar esto solo."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es klingt, als könnte etwas Ernstes passiert sein. Du musst das nicht allein bewältigen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's been two days since your last Chill. How are you really feeling: sleep, mood, energy?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het is twee dagen geleden sinds je laatste Chill. Hoe voel je je echt: slaap, stemming, energie?"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Han pasado dos días desde tu último Chill. ¿Cómo te sientes de verdad: sueño, ánimo, energía?"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es ist zwei Tage seit deinem letzten Chill her. Wie fühlst du dich wirklich: Schlaf, Stimmung, Energie?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its information is drawn from verified, official public-health sources and is updated over time as those sources change. ChillMate and its maker are not liable in any way for decisions made using the app." : {
      "comment" : "A disclaimer that states that the information is drawn from verified, official public health sources and is updated over time. It also states that ChillMate and its maker are not liable for any decisions made using the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Its information is drawn from verified, official public-health sources and is updated over time as those sources change. ChillMate and its maker are not liable in any way for decisions made using the app."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De informatie is afkomstig uit geverifieerde, officiële volksgezondheidsbronnen en wordt na verloop van tijd bijgewerkt als die bronnen veranderen. ChillMate en de maker zijn op geen enkele manier aansprakelijk voor beslissingen die met de app worden genomen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su información procede de fuentes oficiales y verificadas de salud pública y se actualiza con el tiempo a medida que esas fuentes cambian. ChillMate y su creador no se hacen responsables en modo alguno de las decisiones tomadas usando la app."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seine Informationen stammen aus geprüften, offiziellen Quellen des öffentlichen Gesundheitswesens und werden im Lauf der Zeit aktualisiert, wenn sich diese Quellen ändern. ChillMate und sein Entwickler haften in keiner Weise für Entscheidungen, die mithilfe der App getroffen werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
