    "Tips are a voluntary gift to the developer through the App Store. They don't unlock any features or content, everything in ChillMate stays free. Thank you for being here. 💜" : {
      "comment" : "A description of the benefits of tipping the developer.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tips are a voluntary gift to the developer through the App Store. They don't unlock any features or content, everything in ChillMate stays free. Thank you for being here. 💜"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fooien zijn een vrijwillig cadeau aan de ontwikkelaar via de App Store. Ze ontgrendelen geen functies of inhoud, alles in ChillMate blijft gratis. Bedankt dat je er bent. 💜"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las propinas son un regalo voluntario al desarrollador a través de la App Store. No desbloquean ninguna función ni contenido, todo en ChillMate sigue siendo gratis. Gracias por estar aquí. 💜"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trinkgelder sind ein freiwilliges Geschenk an den Entwickler über den App Store. Sie schalten keine Funktionen oder Inhalte frei, alles in ChillMate bleibt kostenlos. Danke, dass du hier bist. 💜"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To create encrypted backups only when backup features are enabled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Om versleutelde back-ups te maken, alleen wanneer back-upfuncties zijn ingeschakeld."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para crear copias de seguridad cifradas solo cuando las funciones de copia estén activadas."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Um verschlüsselte Backups nur zu erstellen, wenn Backup-Funktionen aktiviert sind."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To show your private overview, reminders, aftercare prompts, STI follow-ups, emergency shortcuts, and wellbeing reflections." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Om je privéoverzicht, herinneringen, nazorgmeldingen, soa-opvolgingen, noodsnelkoppelingen en welzijnsreflecties te tonen."
