    "Use oral, genital, and anal fields to match where testing was done. If you are unsure, mark pending and ask the clinic what samples were included." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to interpret STI test results.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use oral, genital, and anal fields to match where testing was done. If you are unsure, mark pending and ask the clinic what samples were included."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gebruik de orale, genitale en anale velden om aan te geven waar is getest. Weet je het niet zeker, markeer dan als in afwachting en vraag de kliniek welke monsters zijn meegenomen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usa los campos oral, genital y anal según dónde se hicieron las pruebas. Si no estás seguro, márcalo como pendiente y pregunta en la clínica qué muestras se incluyeron."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nutze die Felder oral, genital und anal, je nachdem, wo getestet wurde. Wenn du unsicher bist, markiere es als ausstehend und frag die Praxis, welche Proben enthalten waren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
