    "You have logged %lld Chills involving sex and substances in the last 3 weeks. That pattern can carry physical and mental health risks." : {
      "comment" : "A warning that a user has logged a number of Chills that may have health implications. The argument is the number of Chills.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
